    "id": 12,
    "topic": "Four Operations",
    "question": "There were some red, yellow and blue toy cars in a box. 3/8 of the toy cars were red and 26 were blue. The rest were yellow. If there were 12 fewer yellow toy cars than blue toy cars, how many red toy cars were there?",
    "answer": "24 red toy cars",
    "model": "unit-bar",
    "hint": "Use the 12-car difference to find the yellow cars. Then combine yellow and blue cars and relate that total to the 5/8 that are not red.",
    "solution": {
      "en": {
        "strategy": "Use the 12-car difference to find yellow cars, then relate yellow plus blue to 5/8 of the total.",
        "steps": [
          {
            "title": "Find the yellow cars",
            "text": "There are 26 blue cars and 12 fewer yellow cars, so yellow cars = 26 − 12 = 14."
          },
          {
            "title": "Find the total",
            "text": "Yellow and blue cars total 14 + 26 = 40. They are the 5/8 that are not red, so 5/8 of the total is 40."
          },
          {
            "title": "Find the red cars",
            "text": "The total is 40 × 8 ÷ 5 = 64. Red cars are 3/8 of 64, which is 64 × 3/8 = 24."
          }
        ],
        "answerCheck": "24 red toy cars"
      },
      "zh-Hans": {
        "strategy": "先利用12辆的差求黄色玩具车，再把黄车和蓝车看作总数的5/8。",
        "steps": [
          {
            "title": "求黄色玩具车数量",
            "text": "蓝色有26辆，黄色比蓝色少12辆，所以黄色有26 − 12 = 14辆。"
          },
          {
            "title": "求总数",
            "text": "黄色和蓝色共有14 + 26 = 40辆，这正是非红色的5/8，所以总数的5/8 = 40。"
          },
          {
            "title": "求红色玩具车数量",
            "text": "总数是40 × 8 ÷ 5 = 64辆。红色占64的3/8，即64 × 3/8 = 24辆。"
          }
        ],
        "answerCheck": "有24辆红色玩具车。"
      }
    },
