    "topic": "Four Operations",
    "question": "Sandra, Ted and Justina had 377 coins altogether. Sandra gave Justina 15 coins and Ted received 13 coins from Justina. In the end, the ratio of Sandra's coins to Ted's coins was 4 : 3, and the ratio of Sandra's coins to Justina's coins was 3 : 2. How many coins did each have at 1st?",
    "answer": "Sandra: 171 coins; Ted: 104 coins; Justina: 102 coins",
    "model": "bar-change",
    "hint": "Combine the 4:3 and 3:2 final ratios using a common Sandra value. Use the unchanged total of 377, then reverse both transfers.",
    "solution": {
      "en": {
        "strategy": "Combine the two final ratios, use the unchanged total, then reverse the transfers.",
        "steps": [
          {
            "title": "Combine the final ratios",
            "text": "Sandra : Ted = 4 : 3 and Sandra : Justina = 3 : 2. Make Sandra 12 parts: the final ratio Sandra : Ted : Justina is 12 : 9 : 8."
          },
          {
            "title": "Find the final numbers",
            "text": "There are 12 + 9 + 8 = 29 parts, and 377 ÷ 29 = 13 coins per part. Finally, Sandra has 156, Ted 117, and Justina 104 coins."
          },
          {
            "title": "Reverse both transfers",
            "text": "Sandra gave away 15, so she began with 156 + 15 = 171. Ted received 13, so he began with 117 − 13 = 104. Justina received 15 then gave 13, so she began with 104 − 15 + 13 = 102."
          }
        ],
        "answerCheck": "Check: 171 + 104 + 102 = 377. After the transfers: Sandra 156, Ted 117, Justina 104, giving 156:117 = 4:3 and 156:104 = 3:2. Answer: Sandra: 171 coins; Ted: 104 coins; Justina: 102 coins."
      },
      "zh-Hans": {
        "strategy": "合并最后的两个比，利用不变的总数，再倒推转移。",
        "steps": [
          {
            "title": "合并最后的比",
            "text": "Sandra : Ted = 4 : 3，Sandra : Justina = 3 : 2。把Sandra化为12份，最后Sandra : Ted : Justina = 12 : 9 : 8。"
          },
          {
            "title": "求最后的数量",
            "text": "总份数是12 + 9 + 8 = 29份，每份是377 ÷ 29 = 13枚。最后Sandra有156枚，Ted有117枚，Justina有104枚。"
          },
          {
            "title": "倒推两次转移",
            "text": "Sandra给出15枚，所以开始有156 + 15 = 171枚。Ted得到13枚，所以开始有117 − 13 = 104枚。Justina先得到15枚再给出13枚，所以开始有104 − 15 + 13 = 102枚。"
          }
        ],
        "answerCheck": "检验：171 + 104 + 102 = 377。转移后Sandra有156枚，Ted有117枚，Justina有104枚，156:117 = 4:3，156:104 = 3:2。答案：Sandra有171枚；Ted有104枚；Justina有102枚硬币。"
      }
    },
