    "id": 36,
    "topic": "Measurement",
    "question": "ACEH is a rectangle. Its length is 5 times its breadth, and its length is 30 cm. BC is 12 cm. D is the midpoint of CE and G is the midpoint of HF. In the diagram, segments BD and BG form 2 unshaded triangles, BCD and BFG. Find the total area of the shaded portions.",
    "answer": "135 cm2",
    "model": "geometry",
    "hint": "Find the rectangle's breadth from its length-to-breadth relationship. Find the area of the whole rectangle, then subtract the areas of triangles BCD and BFG.",
    "solution": {
      "en": {
        "strategy": "Find the rectangle's dimensions, calculate its area, and subtract the two unshaded triangles.",
        "steps": [
          {
            "title": "Find the rectangle area",
            "text": "The breadth is 30 ÷ 5 = 6 cm, so rectangle ACEH has area 30 × 6 = 180 cm2."
          },
          {
            "title": "Find triangle BCD",
            "text": "D is the midpoint of CE, so CD = 6 ÷ 2 = 3 cm. Area of triangle BCD = 1/2 × 12 × 3 = 18 cm2."
          },
          {
            "title": "Find triangle BFG and subtract",
            "text": "BF = 6 cm and HF = 30 − 12 = 18 cm, so midpoint G gives FG = 18 ÷ 2 = 9 cm. Area of triangle BFG = 1/2 × 9 × 6 = 27 cm2. Shaded area = 180 − 18 − 27 = 135 cm2."
          }
        ],
        "answerCheck": "The checked total shaded area is 135 cm2."
      },
      "zh-Hans": {
        "strategy": "先求长方形的尺寸和面积，再减去2个未阴影三角形的面积。",
        "steps": [
          {
            "title": "求长方形面积",
            "text": "宽是30 ÷ 5 = 6 cm，所以长方形ACEH的面积是30 × 6 = 180 cm2。"
          },
          {
            "title": "求三角形BCD的面积",
            "text": "D是CE的中点，所以CD = 6 ÷ 2 = 3 cm。三角形BCD的面积是1/2 × 12 × 3 = 18 cm2。"
          },
          {
            "title": "求三角形BFG并相减",
            "text": "BF = 6 cm，HF = 30 − 12 = 18 cm；G是HF的中点，所以FG = 18 ÷ 2 = 9 cm。三角形BFG的面积是1/2 × 9 × 6 = 27 cm2。阴影总面积是180 − 18 − 27 = 135 cm2。"
          }
        ],
        "answerCheck": "答案：阴影部分总面积是135 cm2。"
      }
    },
    "questionZh": "ACEH是一个长方形。它的长是宽的5倍，长为30 cm。BC为12 cm。D是CE的中点，G是HF的中点。在图中，线段BD和BG形成2个未阴影三角形BCD和BFG。求阴影部分的总面积。",
