    "id": 40,
    "topic": "Measurement",
    "question": "In rectangle ABEG, the ratio of the shaded area to the unshaded area is 5 : 3, and the rectangle's area is 152 cm2. The area of triangle BCE is to the area of triangle AGF as 3 : 2. Triangle CDE has area 1/4 of the area of rectangle ABEG. Find the difference between the total shaded area and the total unshaded area of the figure.",
    "answer": "85.5 cm2",
    "model": "geometry",
    "hint": "Use the 5 : 3 split to find the shaded and unshaded areas inside the rectangle. Then use the triangle-area ratio and add the appropriate outside triangles.",
    "solution": {
      "en": {
        "strategy": "Split rectangle ABEG by the 5:3 area ratio, then use the given triangle information to total all shaded and unshaded parts.",
        "steps": [
          {
            "title": "Split rectangle ABEG",
            "text": "The 5 : 3 split has 8 units. Each unit is 152 ÷ 8 = 19 cm2, so the shaded part in the rectangle is 5 × 19 = 95 cm2 and the unshaded part is 3 × 19 = 57 cm2."
          },
          {
            "title": "Find the outside triangle areas",
            "text": "Triangle CDE is 1/4 × 152 = 38 cm2. Triangle AGF is the 57 cm2 unshaded triangle. Since BCE : AGF = 3 : 2, triangle BCE has area 57 ÷ 2 × 3 = 85.5 cm2."
          },
          {
            "title": "Compare the totals",
            "text": "Total shaded area = 95 + 85.5 = 180.5 cm2. Total unshaded area = 57 + 38 = 95 cm2. Difference = 180.5 − 95 = 85.5 cm2."
          }
        ],
        "answerCheck": "The checked difference between total shaded and unshaded area is 85.5 cm2."
      },
      "zh-Hans": {
        "strategy": "先按5 : 3分出长方形ABEG的面积，再用三角形条件分别合计阴影和未阴影面积。",
        "steps": [
          {
            "title": "分出长方形ABEG的面积",
            "text": "5 : 3共8份。每份是152 ÷ 8 = 19 cm2，所以长方形内的阴影面积是5 × 19 = 95 cm2，未阴影面积是3 × 19 = 57 cm2。"
          },
          {
            "title": "求外部三角形面积",
            "text": "三角形CDE的面积是1/4 × 152 = 38 cm2。三角形AGF是面积为57 cm2的未阴影三角形。BCE : AGF = 3 : 2，所以三角形BCE的面积是57 ÷ 2 × 3 = 85.5 cm2。"
          },
          {
            "title": "比较总面积",
            "text": "阴影总面积是95 + 85.5 = 180.5 cm2。未阴影总面积是57 + 38 = 95 cm2。差是180.5 − 95 = 85.5 cm2。"
          }
        ],
        "answerCheck": "答案：阴影总面积与未阴影总面积相差85.5 cm2。"
      }
    },
    "questionZh": "在长方形ABEG中，阴影面积与未阴影面积之比是5 : 3，且该长方形的面积是152 cm2。三角形BCE的面积与三角形AGF的面积之比是3 : 2。三角形CDE的面积是长方形ABEG面积的1/4。求图形中阴影总面积与未阴影总面积的差。",
