    "question": "In the figure, GF is 2/5 of BG, JG is 2/5 of AF, GF is 3/5 of HF, EC is 1/2 of FC, and FC = AF. AFC is a straight line. AF = 18 cm, BG = 12 cm, and ED = 10 cm. Find the total area of the shaded portions.",
    "answer": "225 cm2",
    "model": "geometry",
    "hint": "Use the fractional relationships to find GF, JG, HF and EC. Work out the areas of the component triangles before combining shaded and unshaded parts.",
    "solution": {
      "en": {
        "strategy": "Use the fractional length relationships to calculate the component triangles, then subtract the one unshaded triangle from the whole figure.",
        "steps": [
          {
            "title": "Find the unknown lengths",
            "text": "GF = 2/5 × BG = 2/5 × 12 = 4.8 cm. JG = 2/5 × AF = 2/5 × 18 = 7.2 cm. Since GF = 3/5 of HF, HF = 4.8 ÷ 3 × 5 = 8 cm. Also EC = 1/2 × FC = 9 cm and BF = BG + GF = 12 + 4.8 = 16.8 cm."
          },
          {
            "title": "Find the component areas",
            "text": "Area ABF = 1/2 × 18 × 16.8 = 151.2 cm2; area ECD = 1/2 × 9 × 10 = 45 cm2; area HCF = 1/2 × 8 × 18 = 72 cm2; and area BGJ = 1/2 × 12 × 7.2 = 43.2 cm2."
          },
          {
            "title": "Calculate the shaded total",
            "text": "Whole figure area = 151.2 + 45 + 72 = 268.2 cm2. The unshaded triangle BGJ is 43.2 cm2, so shaded area = 268.2 − 43.2 = 225 cm2."
          }
        ],
        "answerCheck": "The checked total shaded area is 225 cm2."
      },
      "zh-Hans": {
        "strategy": "先用分数长度关系求各线段，再计算组成三角形的面积，最后从整个图形中减去未阴影三角形。",
        "steps": [
          {
            "title": "求未知长度",
            "text": "GF = 2/5 × BG = 2/5 × 12 = 4.8 cm。JG = 2/5 × AF = 2/5 × 18 = 7.2 cm。GF是HF的3/5，所以HF = 4.8 ÷ 3 × 5 = 8 cm。EC = 1/2 × FC = 9 cm，BF = BG + GF = 12 + 4.8 = 16.8 cm。"
          },
          {
            "title": "求各部分面积",
            "text": "ABF的面积 = 1/2 × 18 × 16.8 = 151.2 cm2；ECD的面积 = 1/2 × 9 × 10 = 45 cm2；HCF的面积 = 1/2 × 8 × 18 = 72 cm2；BGJ的面积 = 1/2 × 12 × 7.2 = 43.2 cm2。"
          },
          {
            "title": "计算阴影总面积",
            "text": "整个图形面积 = 151.2 + 45 + 72 = 268.2 cm2。未阴影三角形BGJ面积为43.2 cm2，所以阴影面积 = 268.2 − 43.2 = 225 cm2。"
          }
        ],
        "answerCheck": "答案：阴影部分总面积是225 cm2。"
      }
    },
