    "id": 46,
    "topic": "Measurement",
    "question": "Josephine had $80 more than Alex. If Alex gave Josephine $16, Josephine would have 3 times as much money as Alex. How much did each have at first?",
    "answer": "Josephine: $152; Alex: $72",
    "model": "bar-change",
    "hint": "After the $16 transfer, preserve the original $80 difference while accounting for the $16 lost by Alex and the $16 gained by Josephine.",
    "solution": {
      "en": {
        "strategy": "Adjust the original $80 difference for the $16 transfer in both directions, then use the final 3:1 ratio.",
        "steps": [
          {
            "title": "Find the final difference",
            "text": "Josephine originally had $80 more. Receiving $16 while Alex gives $16 increases the difference by $16 + $16 = $32, so the final difference is $80 + $32 = $112."
          },
          {
            "title": "Use the final ratio",
            "text": "After the transfer, Josephine : Alex = 3 : 1. The difference of 2 units is $112, so 1 unit is $112 ÷ 2 = $56. Josephine then has 3 × $56 = $168 and Alex has $56."
          },
          {
            "title": "Reverse the transfer",
            "text": "Initially Josephine had $168 − $16 = $152, and Alex had $56 + $16 = $72."
          }
        ],
        "answerCheck": "The checked initial amounts are Josephine: $152; Alex: $72."
      },
      "zh-Hans": {
        "strategy": "先把原来的$80差额按$16转账的双方变化调整，再用最后的3 : 1关系求解。",
        "steps": [
          {
            "title": "求最后的差额",
            "text": "Josephine原来多$80。她收到$16而Alex付出$16，差额增加$16 + $16 = $32，所以最后差额是$80 + $32 = $112。"
          },
          {
            "title": "利用最后的比",
            "text": "转账后Josephine : Alex = 3 : 1，2份的差额是$112，所以1份是$112 ÷ 2 = $56。Josephine当时有3 × $56 = $168，Alex有$56。"
          },
          {
            "title": "还原转账前的金额",
            "text": "最初Josephine有$168 − $16 = $152，Alex有$56 + $16 = $72。"
          }
        ],
        "answerCheck": "答案：Josephine有$152；Alex有$72。"
      }
    },
