    "id": 83,
    "topic": "2-part: Measurement",
    "question": "Samuel spent 1/2 of his salary and gave 1/3 of the remainder to his wife. His daughters Beatrice, Felicia and Joyce shared the rest in the ratio 1 : 3 : 2. If Felicia received $1080, (a) what was Samuel's salary? (b) How many percent more did Samuel spend than give to his wife?",
    "answer": "(a) $6480; (b) 33 1/3%",
    "model": "fraction-of-remainder",
    "hint": "Use Felicia's 3 ratio units to find the daughters' total. That total is the part left after the spending and the amount given to Samuel's wife.",
    "solution": {
      "en": {
        "strategy": "Use Felicia’s 3 ratio units to find the daughters’ share, then compare the spending difference with the full salary.",
        "steps": [
          {
            "title": "Find the daughters’ shared amount",
            "text": "The ratio 1:3:2 has 6 units. Felicia’s 3 units are $1080, so 1 unit is $360 and all daughters received 6 × $360 = $2160."
          },
          {
            "title": "Find the salary parts",
            "text": "The daughters receive 2 of 6 equal salary units, so 1 salary unit is $2160 ÷ 2 = $1080. The 6-unit salary is 6 × $1080 = $6480."
          },
          {
            "title": "Compare with the full salary",
            "text": "Samuel spent 3 units and gave his wife 1 unit. The difference is 2 of 6 salary units, so 2/6 × 100% = 33 1/3%."
          }
        ],
        "answerCheck": "(a) $6480; (b) 33 1/3%"
      },
      "zh-Hans": {
        "strategy": "先用Felicia的3份求女儿们的金额，再把花掉与给妻子的差额和整份薪水比较。",
        "steps": [
          {
            "title": "求女儿们分得的总金额",
            "text": "比1:3:2共有6份。Felicia的3份是$1080，所以1份是$360，3个女儿共得6 × $360 = $2160。"
          },
          {
            "title": "求薪水的单位份",
            "text": "女儿们得到薪水6等份中的2份，所以1份薪水是$2160 ÷ 2 = $1080。6份薪水是6 × $1080 = $6480。"
          },
          {
            "title": "与整份薪水比较",
            "text": "Samuel花掉3份，给妻子1份，相差2份，占6份薪水的2/6，所以2/6 × 100% = 33 1/3%。"
          }
        ],
        "answerCheck": "（a）$6480；（b）33 1/3%。"
      }
    },
