    "id": 85,
    "topic": "2-part: Measurement",
    "question": "A tank with a square base of sides 10 cm was 3/4 filled with water. 1/2 the water was poured into an empty container, filling it to the brim. 2/3 of the water in the container was poured into a basin that was already 1/5 filled with 700 cm³ of water. The basin then became 1/2 full. (a) What was the original water level in the tank? (b) What was the height of the tank?",
    "answer": "(a) 31.5 cm; (b) 42 cm",
    "model": "fraction-of-remainder",
    "hint": "Work backwards from the basin. Its 1/5-full volume is 700 cm³, so find the transferred water, then the container volume and the original tank volume.",
    "solution": {
      "en": {
        "strategy": "Work backwards from the basin’s known 1/5-full volume to find the water transferred, the container volume, and then the tank water depth.",
        "steps": [
          {
            "title": "Find the water poured into the basin",
            "text": "If 1/5 of the basin is 700 cm³, its full capacity is 700 × 5 = 3500 cm³. At 1/2 full it holds 3500 ÷ 2 = 1750 cm³, so the transfer was 1750 − 700 = 1050 cm³."
          },
          {
            "title": "Find the original tank water volume",
            "text": "The 1050 cm³ was 2/3 of the container’s water, so the full container held 1050 ÷ 2 × 3 = 1575 cm³. This was 1/2 of the tank’s original water, so the tank originally held 1575 × 2 = 3150 cm³."
          },
          {
            "title": "Find both heights",
            "text": "The square base area is 10 × 10 = 100 cm². Original water level = 3150 ÷ 100 = 31.5 cm. Since this was 3/4 of the tank height, height = 31.5 ÷ 3 × 4 = 42 cm."
          }
        ],
        "answerCheck": "(a) 31.5 cm; (b) 42 cm"
      },
      "zh-Hans": {
        "strategy": "从水盆已知的1/5装有700 cm³倒推，先求倒入水盆的水量、容器体积，再求水箱中水的高度。",
        "steps": [
          {
            "title": "求倒入水盆的水量",
            "text": "水盆的1/5是700 cm³，所以水盆容量是700 × 5 = 3500 cm³。水盆装到1/2时有3500 ÷ 2 = 1750 cm³，因此倒入了1750 − 700 = 1050 cm³。"
          },
          {
            "title": "求水箱原有的水量",
            "text": "1050 cm³是容器中水的2/3，所以容器装满时有1050 ÷ 2 × 3 = 1575 cm³。这是水箱原有水量的1/2，因此水箱原有1575 × 2 = 3150 cm³。"
          },
          {
            "title": "求两个高度",
            "text": "正方形底面积是10 × 10 = 100 cm²。原来水位是3150 ÷ 100 = 31.5 cm。它是水箱高度的3/4，所以水箱高31.5 ÷ 3 × 4 = 42 cm。"
          }
        ],
        "answerCheck": "答案：(a) 31.5 cm；(b) 42 cm。"
      }
    },
    "questionZh": "某水箱的底面是边长为10 cm的正方形，箱内的水装到3/4满。将其中的1/2倒入空容器，恰好装满该容器。再将容器中水的2/3倒入水盆；水盆原本装有700 cm³的水，且已装到1/5满。水盆随后装到1/2满。(a) 水箱中原来的水位是多少？(b) 水箱的高度是多少？",
    "hintZh": "从水盆倒推。水盆装到1/5满时有700 cm³的水，先求倒入水盆的水量，再求容器的容积和水箱原有的水量。",
