    "id": 88,
    "topic": "2-part: Measurement",
    "question": "A container measures 18 cm by 22 cm by 30 cm. It is 1/2 filled with water. Water from a jug is then poured into it, increasing the volume of water by 1/3 of its original volume. (a) How much more water is needed to fill the container completely? (b) After the jug water is added, a tap flows at 660 cm³ per minute into the container. How long will it take to fill the container to the brim?",
    "answer": "(a) 3960 cm³; (b) 6 minutes",
    "model": "fraction-of-remainder",
    "hint": "Find the container's full volume. The jug increases the initial 1/2-full amount by 1/3 of that initial amount, so find the new fraction full.",
    "solution": {
      "en": {
        "strategy": "Find the full container volume, then track the fraction full after the jug water is added.",
        "steps": [
          {
            "title": "Find the container capacity",
            "text": "The full volume is 18 cm × 22 cm × 30 cm = 11,880 cm³. At 1/2 full, it contains 11,880 ÷ 2 = 5,940 cm³."
          },
          {
            "title": "Add the jug water",
            "text": "The jug increases the original water volume by 1/3 × 5,940 = 1,980 cm³. The container then holds 5,940 + 1,980 = 7,920 cm³, which is 2/3 full."
          },
          {
            "title": "Find the missing volume and time",
            "text": "The missing water is 11,880 - 7,920 = 3,960 cm³. At 660 cm³ per minute, the time is 3,960 ÷ 660 = 6 minutes."
          }
        ],
        "answerCheck": "Check: (a) 3960 cm³; (b) 6 minutes"
      },
      "zh-Hans": {
        "strategy": "先求容器总体积，再追踪加入壶中水后的装满分数。",
        "steps": [
          {
            "title": "求容器容量",
            "text": "总体积是 18 cm × 22 cm × 30 cm = 11,880 cm³。装到 1/2 时有 11,880 ÷ 2 = 5,940 cm³。"
          },
          {
            "title": "加入壶中的水",
            "text": "壶中水使原有水量增加 1/3 × 5,940 = 1,980 cm³。加入后有 5,940 + 1,980 = 7,920 cm³，即装到 2/3。"
          },
          {
            "title": "求还需水量和时间",
            "text": "还需 11,880 - 7,920 = 3,960 cm³。水龙头每分钟流 660 cm³，所需时间是 3,960 ÷ 660 = 6 分钟。"
          }
        ],
        "answerCheck": "验算：(a) 3960 cm³；(b) 6 分钟"
      }
    },
    "questionZh": "一个容器的长、宽、高分别为18 cm、22 cm和30 cm。容器装有1/2的水。随后把水壶里的水倒入容器，使水的体积增加原有体积的1/3。(a) 还需要多少水才能把容器完全装满？(b) 加入水壶里的水后，水龙头以每分钟660 cm³的流量向容器注水。注满容器需要多长时间？",
    "hintZh": "先求容器的总容量。水壶里的水使原来装有1/2的水量增加其原有体积的1/3，因此求出加入后容器装满的分数。",
